"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[73227],{73227:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/bat.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Bat\\"\\n          author=\\"Jo Nesb\xf8\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Bichae\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2014-02-27\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791185014449\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI heard that <mark>The Snowman</mark> in the Harry Hole series is interesting, so I inevitably started from the first in the series.  \\nDescriptions of detective ```Harry Hole```\'s character and his past stories appear bit by bit.  \\nHe is portrayed as an alcoholic and a ```shaky young detective```, drawn as a charming character for readers.  \\nIt seems this series received much love as the character became more solid and clear with each release.  \\n<br>\\nIt\'s full of typical Western thriller vibes.  \\nThere\'s a twist regarding the culprit, but I felt it was a bit too sudden and the foreshadowing was weak.  \\nWhat if there were more breadcrumbs?\\n<br>\\nI did end up buying all the subsequent series anyway."}')}}]);